{"id":"vod_sn_37621","vodId":"37621","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"冲击轰雷岩","name_cn":"冲击轰雷岩","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/c2c97a83ff94caab973f197e5f4bfe2f.jpg"},"summary":"《冲击轰雷岩》，原名《冲击Gouraigan》，又译《冲击豪烈刚》，是接档《牙狼》第三季的特摄片。普通女生界瞳可以看到许多奇怪的东西，比如便利店的顾客和朋友的男朋友，在外人看他们只是普通的人类，而在小瞳眼里他们却有着怪物形态。与此同时，押送囚人前往流刑之地的轰和娜薇在途中遭到玛吉的袭击，而其实这都是讯的阴谋，他的目的是统治地球。打斗中龟甲宇宙船坠落地球，讯伪装成了人类。而另一边，立志保护地球的轰碰到了小瞳。bym.yakubd.cc","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:54:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/t0BmHh7Pwh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ethcS6F2nV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/pKXhZrNFjt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/FzXsFmFw7w1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/sgDTCMFsMa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/mwYpD2e2S71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/U73gLYX4VM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/zKZjsTPXLF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/upmcNFjZsw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/zvLt85dY6Y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/BbJSF3KeXd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/LbCJPbRFxy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/bBitQzpTKu1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:08.703Z"}